-secondary" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1"><span class="print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:sr-only">ChatGPT сказал:</span><span class="hidden print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:inline" aria-hidden="true">ChatGPT</span></h4><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="local-chatgpt:8a037c58-9521-4f30-baed-da4cee3f1772" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="4ede9d01-0e6b-43ba-801f-36a29d711ede"><span hidden=""></span><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_4cv_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Жақсы! 👍 Қазір сен GitHub-тағы </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">index.html</span><span> файлын ашып тұрсың. Файл дұрыс аталған. Бірақ бұл бет — кодтың өзі, ойынның сайты емес.</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Енді Firebase кодын тексерейік.</span></p><h3 class="Heading-Ro3lZr" dir="auto"><span>✅ 1-қадам. Кодтан Firebase сөзін ізде</span></h3><ol class="List-kOVW5V OrderedList-XsMUSX" dir="auto" start="1"><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Пернетақтадан </span><strong class="font-semibold"><span>Ctrl + F</span></strong><span> бас.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Іздеу жолағына </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">firebaseConfig</span><span> деп жаз.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Enter бас.</span></li></ol><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Егер табылмаса, </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">initializeApp</span><span> деп іздеп көр.</span></p><h3 class="Heading-Ro3lZr" dir="auto"><span>✅ 2-қадам. Нәтижесін айт</span></h3><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><strong class="font-semibold"><span>Қайсысы шықты?</span></strong></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><strong class="font-semibold"><span>1</span></strong><span> — </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">firebaseConfig</span><span> табылды.</span><br><strong class="font-semibold"><span>2</span></strong><span> — </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">initializeApp</span><span> табылды, бірақ </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">firebaseConfig</span><span> жоқ.</span><br><strong class="font-semibold"><span>3</span></strong><span> — Екеуі де табылмады.</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Тек </span><strong class="font-semibold"><span>1, 2 немесе 3</span></strong><span> деп жаз. Содан кейін Firebase пен ойынды байланыстырудың келесі қадамын көрсетемін.</span></p></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full e