ill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block-BQZwFn"><span hidden="" data-chatgpt-agent-turn-start=""></span><div data-content-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-61:1:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-61:1:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-message-ids="c0d8428c-8bfb-4faf-874d-4aba920292b3 c0d8428c-8bfb-4faf-874d-4aba920292b3"><h4 class="sr-only m-0 select-none print:not-sr-only print:mt-4 print:mb-2 print:text-xs print:leading-normal print:font-bold print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:mt-6 print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:font-normal print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:text-secondary" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1"><span class="print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:sr-only">ChatGPT сказал:</span><span class="hidden print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:inline" aria-hidden="true">ChatGPT</span></h4><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="local-chatgpt:8a037c58-9521-4f30-baed-da4cee3f1772" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="c0d8428c-8bfb-4faf-874d-4aba920292b3"><span hidden=""></span><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_49u_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Жақсы! Енді нақты себебін таптық. ✅</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Скриншотта </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">firebaseConfig</span><span> іздегенде </span><strong class="font-semibold"><span>0/0</span></strong><span> деп тұр. Демек, GitHub Pages ашып тұрған </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">index.html</span><span> файлының ішінде Firebase коды жоқ.</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Бірақ сенің ойыныңды қайта жасаудың қажеті жоқ. Firebase кодын ойынға қосу керек.</span></p><h2 class="Heading-Ro3lZr" dir="auto"><span>🔧 Енді не істейміз?</span></h2><h3 class="Heading-Ro3lZr" dir="auto"><span>1-қадам. Firebase файлын аш</span></h3><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>GitHub репозиторийіңе қайтып бар:</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><a data-inline-mention-interactive="" class="ExternalMarkdownLink-WWBYg9 InlineMentionFocusRing-j8iO1a" href="https://github.com/maloubinka166-commits/BRAWL-MATH?utm_source=chatgpt.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-search-result-target=""><span class="Mention-hIgCkC" data-appearance="inline-mention" data-font-weight="medium" data-layout="inline-flow" data-tone="accent" data-underline-on-hover=""><span data-markdown-copy="exclude" class="IconContainer-K62H88 SlotSizedIconContainer-xXGVqL"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="Icon-TZxsTm SlotSizedIcon-mWPuaA"><path d="M9.99996 2.08002C14.373 2.08002 17.915 5.62198 17.915 9.99502C17.9145 11.6534 17.3941 13.2699 16.4268 14.617C15.4595 15.9641 14.0941 16.9739 12.5229 17.5044C12.1271 17.5835 11.9787 17.3362 11.9787 17.1284C11.9787 16.8613 11.9886 16.0104 11.9886 14.9518C11.9886 14.2098 11.7413 13.7349 11.4543 13.4875C13.2154 13.2896 15.0656 12.6169 15.0656 9.57948C15.0656 8.70883 14.7589 8.00637 14.2543 7.45232C14.3334 7.25445 14.6104 6.44316 14.1751 5.35485C14.1751 5.35485 13.5122 5.13719 11.9985 6.16614C11.3653 5.98805 10.6925 5.899 10.0197 5.899C9.34697 5.899 8.6742 5.98805 8.041 6.16614C6.52726 5.14708 5.86437 5.35485 5.86437 5.35485C5.42905 6.44316 5.70607 7.25445 5.78522 7.45232C5.28064 8.00637 4.97394 8.71872 4.97394 9.57948C4.97394 12.607 6.81417 13.2896 8.57526 13.4875C8.3477 13.6854 8.13994 14.0317 8.07068 14.5461C7.61557 14.7539 6.47779 15.0903 5.76544 13.8932C5.61703 13.6557 5.17181 13.072 4.54851 13.0819C3.88562 13.0918 4.28137 13.4578 4.5584 13.6062C4.89479 13.7942 5.28064 14.4967 5.36969 14.7242C5.52799 15.1694 6.04246 16.0203 8.03111 15.6542C8.03111 16.3171 8.041 16.9404 8.041 17.1284C8.041 17.3362 7.89259 17.5736 7.49684 17.5044C5.92041 16.9796 4.54923 15.9718 3.57782 14.6239C2.60641 13.276 2.08409 11.6565 2.08496 9.99502C2.08496 5.62198 5.62692 2.08002 9.99996 2.08002Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="Label-arpLwJ"><span>BRAWL-MATH репозиторийі</span></span></span></a></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Сол жақтағы файлдар тізімінен бұрынғы </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">index.html</span><span> файлының орнына жүктеген Firebase нұсқасы бар ма, тексер.</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Қазір сенде </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">index.html</span><span> — ескі ойын коды, ал Firebase коды жоқ екені анықталды.</span></p><h3 class="Heading-Ro3lZr" dir="auto"><span>2-қадам. Маған бір нәрсені айт</span></h3><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Бұрын мен дайындаған Firebase файлын компьютеріңе жүктеп ала алдың ба?</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><strong class="font-semibold"><span>1</span></strong><span> — Иә, компьютерімде бар.</span><br><strong class="font-semibold"><span>2</span></strong><span> — Жоқ, жүктелмеді.</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Тек </span><strong class="font-semibold"><span>1 немесе 2</span></strong><span> деп жауап бер. Соған қарай ойынды Firebase-пен дұрыс байланыстырудың ең оңай жолын көрсетемін.</span></p></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-cont