v></div></div></div><div class="block-BQZwFn"><span hidden="" data-chatgpt-agent-turn-start=""></span><div data-content-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-62:2:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-62:2:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-message-ids="39898ca0-8960-4ef4-becf-4e238b95b813 39898ca0-8960-4ef4-becf-4e238b95b813"><h4 class="sr-only m-0 select-none print:not-sr-only print:mt-4 print:mb-2 print:text-xs print:leading-normal print:font-bold print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:mt-6 print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:font-normal print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:text-secondary" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1"><span class="print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:sr-only">ChatGPT сказал:</span><span class="hidden print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:inline" aria-hidden="true">ChatGPT</span></h4><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="local-chatgpt:8a037c58-9521-4f30-baed-da4cee3f1772" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="39898ca0-8960-4ef4-becf-4e238b95b813"><span hidden=""></span><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_4at_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Керемет! 👍 Егер Firebase файлы компьютеріңде бар болса, енді оны GitHub-тағы ойынның негізгі файлына дұрыс орналастырамыз.</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><strong class="font-semibold"><span>Маңызды:</span></strong><span> бұрынғы ойыныңды жоғалтпау үшін ешбір файлды әзірге өшірме. Firebase нұсқасын негізгі </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">index.html</span><span> файлына орналастыруымыз керек.</span></p><h2 class="Heading-Ro3lZr" dir="auto"><span>1-қадам. Компьютердегі Firebase файлын дайында</span></h2><ol class="List-kOVW5V OrderedList-XsMUSX" dir="auto" start="1"><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Компьютерден </span><strong class="font-semibold"><span>«Загрузки»</span></strong><span> бумасын аш.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">brawl-math-firebase.html</span><span> файлын тап.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Файлдың атын </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">index.html</span><span> деп өзгерт.</span></li></ol><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Атауы дәл осылай болуы керек:</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">index.html</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><strong class="font-semibold"><span>Ескерту:</span></strong><span> </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">index.html.html</span><span> деп қалмауын тексер.</span></p><h2 class="Heading-Ro3lZr" dir="auto"><span>2-қадам. GitHub-тағы ескі </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">index.html</span><span> файлын ауыстыр</span></h2><ol class="List-kOVW5V OrderedList-XsMUSX" dir="auto" start="1"><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><a data-inline-mention-interactive="" class="ExternalMarkdownLink-WWBYg9 InlineMentionFocusRing-j8iO1a" href="https://github.com/maloubinka166-commits/BRAWL-MATH?utm_source=chatgpt.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-search-result-target=""><span class="Mention-hIgCkC" data-appearance="inline-mention" data-font-weight="medium" data-layout="inline-flow" data-tone="accent" data-underline-on-hover=""><span data-markdown-copy="exclude" class="IconContainer-K62H88 SlotSizedIconContainer-xXGVqL"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="Icon-TZxsTm SlotSizedIcon-mWPuaA"><path d="M9.99996 2.08002C14.373 2.08002 17.915 5.62198 17.915 9.99502C17.9145 11.6534 17.3941 13.2699 16.4268 14.617C15.4595 15.9641 14.0941 16.9739 12.5229 17.5044C12.1271 17.5835 11.9787 17.3362 11.9787 17.1284C11.9787 16.8613 11.9886 16.0104 11.9886 14.9518C11.9886 14.2098 11.7413 13.7349 11.4543 13.4875C13.2154 13.2896 15.0656 12.6169 15.0656 9.57948C15.0656 8.70883 14.7589 8.00637 14.2543 7.45232C14.3334 7.25445 14.6104 6.44316 14.1751 5.35485C14.1751 5.35485 13.5122 5.13719 11.9985 6.16614C11.3653 5.98805 10.6925 5.899 10.0197 5.899C9.34697 5.899 8.6742 5.98805 8.041 6.16614C6.52726 5.14708 5.86437 5.35485 5.86437 5.35485C5.42905 6.44316 5.70607 7.25445 5.78522 7.45232C5.28064 8.00637 4.97394 8.71872 4.97394 9.57948C4.97394 12.607 6.81417 13.2896 8.57526 13.4875C8.3477 13.6854 8.13994 14.0317 8.07068 14.5461C7.61557 14.7539 6.47779 15.0903 5.76544 13.8932C5.61703 13.6557 5.17181 13.072 4.54851 13.0819C3.88562 13.0918 4.28137 13.4578 4.5584 13.6062C4.89479 13.7942 5.28064 14.4967 5.36969 14.7242C5.52799 15.1694 6.04246 16.0203 8.03111 15.6542C8.03111 16.3171 8.041 16.9404 8.041 17.1284C8.041 17.3362 7.89259 17.5736 7.49684 17.5044C5.92041 16.9796 4.54923 15.9718 3.57782 14.6239C2.60641 13.276 2.08409 11.6565 2.08496 9.99502C2.08496 5.62198 5.62692 2.08002 9.99996 2.08002Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="Label-arpLwJ"><span>GitHub репозиторийіңді аш</span></span></span></a><span>.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">index.html</span><span> файлын бас.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Кодтың үстіндегі қарындаштың жанындағы төмен бағытталған көрсеткіні бас.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><strong class="font-semibold"><span>Delete file</span></strong><span> дегенді таңда.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Өзгерісті </span><strong class="font-semibold"><span>Commit changes</span></strong><span> арқылы раста.</span></li></ol><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>⚠️ Қорықпа: </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">brawl math 2.html</span><span> файлыңды өшірмейміз. Ол бұрынғы ойынның көшірмесі болып қалады.</span></p><h2 class="Heading-Ro3lZr" dir="auto"><span>3-қадам. Жаңа файлды жүкте</span></h2><ol class="List-kOVW5V OrderedList-XsMUSX" dir="auto" start="1"><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Репозиторийдің негізгі бетіне қайт.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><strong class="font-semibold"><span>+ → Upload files</span></strong><span> таңда.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Компьютердегі жаңа </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">index.html</span><span> файлын жүкте.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><strong class="font-semibold"><span>Commit changes</span></strong><span> батырмасын бас.</span></li></ol><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Осыдан кейін сайттың негізгі файлы Firebase нұсқасы болады.</span></p><h2 class="Heading-Ro3lZr" dir="auto"><span>4-қадам. Тексеру</span></h2><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Мына сілтемені ашып, </span><strong class="font-semibold"><span>Ctrl + F5</span></strong><span> бас:</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><a data-inline-mention-interactive="" class="ExternalMarkdownLink-WWBYg9 InlineMentionFocusRing-j8iO1a DecoratedExternalLink-p2AJ5C" href="https://maloubinka166-commits.github.io/BRAWL-MATH/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-search-result-target=""><span>BRAWL-MATH ойыны</span></a></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Тіркелу терезесі шыққанын тексереміз.</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><strong class="font-semibold"><span>Алдымен 1-қадамды орында.</span></strong><span> Файлдың атын өзгертіп болған соң маған жаз немесе скриншот жібер. Мен сені келесі қадамға бағыттаймын.</span></p></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 button-icon flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-label="Копировать" data-state="closed"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-xs"><path d="M13.468 11.1216C13.468 10.4107 13.468 9.91717 13.4367 9.53369C13.4137 9.25191 13.3758 9.0622 13.3244 8.91846L13.2687 8.78858C13.1148 8.48652 12.8803 8.23344 12.593 8.05713L12.466 7.98584C12.308 7.90546 12.0963 7.84854 11.7209 7.81787C11.3374 7.78656 10.8439 7.78662 10.133 7.78662H7.29999C6.58895 7.78662 6.09562 7.78654 5.7121 7.81787C5.43015 7.84091 5.24064 7.87872 5.09686 7.93018L4.96698 7.98584C4.66487 8.13977 4.41184 8.37419 4.23554 8.66162L4.16522 8.78858C4.08477 8.94657 4.02794 9.15811 3.99725 9.53369